  DTS:Description="Rebuilds the supplier scorecard: on-time delivery, quantity accuracy, price adherence, quality rejections and invoice accuracy, weighted into a single score band. The weights live in etl.Configuration because procurement changes them every couple of years, and suppliers with too few orders in the window are scored as 'insufficient data' rather than badly."
